[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19320.07, "timestamp": "05:22:00", "text": "Yes. I mean two days ago, my mom, she"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19323.19, "timestamp": "05:22:03", "text": "came into my room and she asked me if I"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19324.35, "timestamp": "05:22:04", "text": "like older"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19327.51, "timestamp": "05:22:07", "text": "women. I'm like, what kind of question"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19329.83, "timestamp": "05:22:09", "text": "is that? So I just said yes and she said"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19331.91, "timestamp": "05:22:11", "text": "and she said nothing. I just went out"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19333.99, "timestamp": "05:22:13", "text": "just she just like went went outside."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19341.07, "timestamp": "05:22:21", "text": "Which is true. I like older"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19344.27, "timestamp": "05:22:24", "text": "women. The experience to me is"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19347.708, "timestamp": "05:22:27", "text": "attractive. But I am getting old now."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19350.788, "timestamp": "05:22:30", "text": "So I think the older women I like will"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19354.51, "timestamp": "05:22:34", "text": "be like normal women for me."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19362.07, "timestamp": "05:22:42", "text": "I mean older women are like people who"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19364.708, "timestamp": "05:22:44", "text": "are so matured and they know about life."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19367.51, "timestamp": "05:22:47", "text": "They want to settle down"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19371.35, "timestamp": "05:22:51", "text": "and everything, right?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19374.39, "timestamp": "05:22:54", "text": "Like every time I broken up with an ex,"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19377.51, "timestamp": "05:22:57", "text": "her mom will be the one who cries the"}, {"type": "ch